OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for causing death of
OL,4,Ateen motorcyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 20-year-old man has been sentenced to
OL,7,Ftwo years in a young offender
OL,8,Finstitution for causing the death of a
OL,9,Fteenage motorcyclist.
OL,11,FKasper Stankiewicz, from Congresbury,
OL,12,Fwas found guilty of death by dangerous
OL,13,Fdriving after he collided with
OL,14,F18-year-old Alfie Gray on the A370 near
OL,15,FHewish, Weston-super-Mare, on 10
OL,16,FSeptember 2024.
OL,18,FGray had been riding his motorbike home
OL,19,Ffrom work when Stankiewicz - who was
OL,20,Ftravelling in the opposite direction -
OL,21,Fovertook a vehicle and fatally struck
OL,22,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
