OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for causing death of
OL,4,Ateen motorcyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Bristol Crown Court earlier,
OL,7,FStankiewicz was also disqualified from
OL,8,Fdriving for six years and must take an
OL,9,Fextended re-test, along with paying a
OL,10,F#187 victim surcharge.
